      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TUCKEROO ROAD (2) is a classy type who was an all the way winner at this track (29.86) making it two straight wins. Solid record at the distance winning three races. Has a strong record out of this box with four wins and a minor placing from nine starts. In great recent form and expected to measure up again. NANGAR ZARA (8) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 4.5 lengths win at Q Lakeside in a handy 30.49. Draws out wide but has the ability and in winning form. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. ANOTHER IDEA (4) hit the frame last time at Q Lakeside but just a few starts ago ran slick time when scoring over 457m at Q Lakeside in 25.34. Should be in this for a long way. RIORSON BALE (1) warrants respect with the drop in journey.",
